UID:165929@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20261109T153449Z
DTSTART:20261102T192400Z
SUMMARY:2026 Preliminary Annual Peak Load
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England released the Forward Capacity Market\, Market Information Server (MIS) report entitled Special Annual Peak Load (SP_FCMANNUALPEAK) on November 2\, 2026. The information is preliminary and may be subject to change in the Data Reconciliation Process.\n\nThe 2026 preliminary annual peak load information has been included in the "ISO New England Annual System Peak Day\, Hour & Load MW " spreadsheet. This spreadsheet is located here.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165929
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165929
END:VEVENT
