BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:165879@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20261109T153449Z
DTSTART:20261103T190000Z
SUMMARY:ISO New England will conduct an outage of Sandbox SMD Applications on Tuesday\, November 3\, 2026\, from 14:00 to 16:00.
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England will conduct an outage of Sandbox SMD Applications on Tuesday\, November 3\, 2026\, from 14:00 to 16:00.\n\nDuring the outage users will not be able to connect to the following Sandbox SMD Applications: Internal Transactions\, Submit Meter Reading\, Submit Peak Contribution\, Submit Monthly Regional Network Load\, and Financial Assurance Management.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165879
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165879
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:165939@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20261109T153449Z
DTSTART:20261103T190000Z
SUMMARY:ISO New England will conduct an outage of Production Settlement Applications from on Tuesday\, November 3rd from 14:00 to 16:00 hrs. for Annual Server Certificate renewal.
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England will conduct an outage of Production Settlement Applications from on Tuesday\, November 3rd from 14:00 to 16:00 hrs. for Annual Server Certificate renewal. During the outage users will not be able to connect to the following Production SMD Applications: Internal Transactions\, Submit Meter Reading\, Submit Peak Contribution\, Submit Monthly Regional Network Load\, and Financial Assurance Management. MIS Operational reports are delayed.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165939
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165939
END:VEVENT
