SUMMARY:Transmission Owner Planning Advisory Committee Meeting 
LOCATION:Webex
DESCRIPTION:The Transmission Owner Planning Advisory Committee (TOPAC) is a transmission owner-led forum. TOPAC discusses and solicits input on each company’s Local System Plan (LSP) and upcoming transmission projects within their areas.\nContact: Steve Allen (Steven.Allen@eversource.com)\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165613
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165613
END:VEVENT
