SUMMARY:Consumer Liaison Group Meeting
LOCATION:Colonnade Hotel (120 Huntington Avenue\, Boston\, MA 02116)
DESCRIPTION:Stakeholder forum between ISO New England and regional consumer organizations and advocates to exchange information about the economic impacts of New England’s bulk power system and wholesale electricity markets.\n\nThis meeting will be held both in-person and virtually.\n\nRegister to attend this meeting in-person.\n\nTo attend the meeting virtually\, please add the meeting details to your calendar\, or join from the link below at 12:30 p.m. on December 2. More meeting details can also be found on the event website.\n\nAdd to My Calendar\n\nWebEx link: https://iso-newengland.webex.com/iso-newengland/j.php?MTID=mb3a67cf5f87f95eba02176f26b717b90\n\nPassword: CLG26!Dec\n\nTeleconference Info: 1-650-479-3208 / Access Code: 2435 864 4676/ Password: 25426033\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=159984
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=159984
